---
// Mode Data BI — sage-ground B2B BI scene: lime announcement sliver, dark "mode"
// wordmark, stacked serif-on-lime highlight pills ("Business Intelligence" /
// "built around data teams"), square dark button, product screenshot slab with
// rounded top. Pure CSS/SVG, cqw units, 16/10 scene.
---

